00:13:18.965 --> 00:13:21.195
and I'm being tempted to go
to this habit over and over

00:13:21.195 --> 00:13:25.971
and over, the key to changing
a habit is not to resist it

00:13:25.971 --> 00:13:27.471
but to replace it.

00:13:29.462 --> 00:13:31.629
Not to resist but refocus.

00:13:33.354 --> 00:13:35.258
If a guy's having problem
with pornography and he's

00:13:35.258 --> 00:13:37.099
watching TV he doesn't just say,

00:13:37.099 --> 00:13:39.033
"No I don't want this, I don't want this."

00:13:39.033 --> 00:13:41.263
He just flips the channel.

00:13:41.263 --> 00:13:45.365
The moment you change the
channel the temptation loses

00:13:45.365 --> 00:13:46.623
it's power on you.

00:13:46.623 --> 00:13:49.532
Do not listen, here's a
pastor telling you this,

00:13:49.532 --> 00:13:51.615
do not resist temptation.

